BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Filipiñana
DTSTART:20261008T231500Z
DTEND:20261009T011000Z
DTSTAMP:20261008T231500Z
UID:CLw6WCGkiZ
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 100 mins (1h40m)\n\nAt a picturesque upscale resort 
 and golf club on the outskirts of Manila\, 17-year-old tee-girl Isabel (Jo
 rrybell Agoto) seeks out Dr. Palanca\, the club's president\, to return a 
 misplaced golf club\, but unexpectedly uncovers a series of dark truths ab
 out her workplace\, elite members\, and her own past.With a delicate and s
 harp perspective\, this film explores class differences\, power structures
 \, and post-colonial realities\, presenting a complex and unsettling pictu
 re of contemporary Philippine society within the seemingly tranquil green 
 golf course.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/filipinana\n\nEsti
 mated start: 16:30
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
